Package: jarvisagent
Version: 0.1-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pip, python3-venv, zlib1g, bash
Maintainer: JC Technolabs <https://github.com/beaumanvienna>
Homepage: https://github.com/beaumanvienna/JarvisAgent
Description: Parallel AI-driven automation with C++ backend and React frontend
 JarvisAgent is a C++ backend / React frontend application for parallel
 AI-driven automation. It dispatches many concurrent AI requests for bulk
 processing workloads, supports visual DAG workflow editing, and ships with
 an ncurses terminal UI and a browser-based React dashboard.
